{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18629","headline":"酬贾鹏山人郡内新栽松寓兴见赠二首 二 · 柳宗元","name":"酬贾鹏山人郡内新栽松寓兴见赠二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无能常闭阁，偶以静见名。\n奇姿来远山，忽似人家生。\n劲色不改旧，芳心与谁荣。\n喧卑岂所安，任物非我情。\n清韵动竽瑟，谐此风中声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}